# shadcn/ui — doc routing (mdeapp)

**App root:** `mdeapp/` only (`components.json` → `base-nova`, RSC, Tailwind v4, `lucide`).  
**Deep rules:** load skill `shadcn` (`.claude/skills/shadcn/` → `rules/forms.md`, `composition.md`, `styling.md`).  
**CLI:** always `cd mdeapp && npx shadcn@latest …` (match project package manager).

## Which doc to open first

| You are doing… | Open | Do not |
|----------------|------|--------|
| New component missing from disk | [Components](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components) → `npx shadcn@latest docs <name>` → `add` | Guess APIs from memory |
| Bootstrap / fix `components.json` | [Next installation](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/installation/next) | Re-init without user approval |
| Understand philosophy / distribution | [Introduction](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs) | Treat as npm black-box library |
| Colors, tokens, dark mode | [Theming](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/theming) — edit `src/app/globals.css` only | Raw `bg-blue-500`, manual `dark:` overrides |
| **Any form** (booking, HITL, auth) | [React Hook Form](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/forms/react-hook-form) + `Field`/`FieldGroup` | TanStack Form, Formisch, `useActionState`, raw `Label`+`div` layout |
| Admin filters / single search box | `Input` only — no full form framework | RHF for one field |
| Dashboard / Patricia metrics | [Charts](https://ui.shadcn.com/charts/area) → add `chart` + Recharts | Custom chart CSS or random npm chart lib |
| Full page shell (login, sidebar dashboard) | [Blocks](https://ui.shadcn.com/blocks) — copy/adapt, then trim | Blocks for one field inside existing `/chat` shell |
| Venue booking sheet (VEN-017+) | RHF + Zod + `Sheet` + `Field` — see `tasks/venues/docs/venues-booking.md` §10.1 | Multi-step wizard, second form impl for 021/019 |

## Forms (required in mdeapp)

```text
FieldGroup → Field → FieldLabel + control (Input / Textarea / Select / Checkbox / Calendar)
useForm + zodResolver(schema)
Invalid: data-invalid on Field, aria-invalid on control
```

Install path: `field`, `input`, `textarea`, `select`, `checkbox`, `calendar` (if date picker) + `react-hook-form` `@hookform/resolvers`.

## Theming (required)

- Use semantic tokens: `bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`.
- Spacing: `flex` + `gap-*` — never `space-x-*` / `space-y-*` on form layout.
- Icons in `Button`: `data-icon="inline-start"` — no `size-4` on icons inside components.

## Charts (when needed)

- Use shadcn `Chart` wrapper + chart CSS variables (`chart-1`…`chart-5` in globals).
- Phase 1 default: **no charts** unless task spec names admin/analytics surface.

## Blocks (when needed)

- Use for **new routes** (e.g. `/admin/*` shell, marketing login) — `npx shadcn add <block-id>`.
- **Not** for CopilotKit chat column, map panel, or generative cards — compose existing `Card`/`Sheet`/`Sidebar` instead.
- After `add`, read generated files; fix imports to `@/components/ui/*` and project `iconLibrary`.

## CLI checklist

1. `npx shadcn@latest info --json` — aliases, installed components, `base` vs `radix`.
2. Check `src/components/ui/` before `add`.
3. `npx shadcn@latest docs <component>` before editing that component.
4. Never `--overwrite` without explicit user OK.

## mdeai surfaces (quick map)

| Surface | shadcn primitives |
|---------|-------------------|
| `/chat` detail column | `Sheet`, `Card`, `ScrollArea`, `Badge`, `Button` |
| Booking (café/restaurant/nightlife) | `Sheet` + RHF `Field` form |
| `/admin/*` queue | `Table`, `Input` filters, `Badge` status |
| Nav (SCREEN-002) | `Sidebar` / `Tooltip` — already wired |
